  "quiz_markdown": "### Q1. Leading tone resolves:\n\n- A) Up to tonic by semitone\n- B) Down to subdominant\n- C) Up by whole tone to mediant\n- D) No preferred direction\n\n**Answer:** A\n\n### Q2. V7 tritone creates tension resolving at cadence.\n\n**Answer:** True",
